{"data":{"title":"We Need A Resolution (Instrumental)","slug":"we-need-a-resolution-instrumental","path":"/artists/aaliyah/tracks/we-need-a-resolution-instrumental/","artwork":"images/artists/aaliyah/tracks/we-need-a-resolution-instrumental.jpg","artist":{"id":"DNPLgNzG_xY","slug":"aaliyah","links":null,"title":"Aaliyah","artwork":null},"id":"mkUKEsMCku4"},"appearanceCount":3,"markers":[{"chapter":{"id":"RSwdFXquFsw","show":{"id":"HDFgu5UTRf4","slug":"182","title":"Soulection Radio Show #182 w/ Ta-ku","artwork":"/images/episodes/182.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-08-09T01:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"UQKUtJsffKA","show":{"id":"cdnqQ9xehXc","slug":"195","title":"Soulection Radio Show #195","artwork":"/images/episodes/195.jpg","content":"Joe Kay continues the freestyle of all music. \n\n<!--more-->\nLast week's show was definitely one of my favorites to date. It's weird how things work. It's the shows that I feel most unprepared for that end up doing well... maybe it's because I just really freestyle and go off of my whole library of music rather than trying to curate a specific vibe. It was hard to top last week's show but I did my best to really take it right back to the early beat era from 2008-2012 and played some current gems as well. I hope you enjoy this. I'll be back next week with a guest maybe.\n\nBless.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","published_at":"2014-11-29T00:00:00+00:00"}}},{"chapter":{"id":"fr7OIycLMFU","show":{"id":"U1yV8BHO-5o","slug":"216","title":"Soulection Radio Show #216","artwork":"/images/episodes/216.jpg","content":"Settle in for an eclectic mix of soul.\n\n\n<!--more-->\n","published_at":"2015-07-11T00:00:00+00:00"}}}],"linkedPlatforms":[{"id":40917,"platform":"lastfm","href":"https://www.last.fm/music/Aaliyah/_/We+Need+A+Resolution+(Instrument